    <p>
      CodeBlueLife is a subsidiary of
      <a
        href="https://venoxity.dev"
        class="text-zinc-400 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-700 transition-colors hover:text-blue-400 hover:decoration-blue-400/60"
